        "id": 1141739
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-16T07:56:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doesn\u0027t i2c_read8 with I2C_FLAG_PEC work?\n\nAlso, is there any reason to enable crc?",
      "revId": "d8af83a4635035338e12a151daf8c1099bdd9764",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "498a2eb1_bd8d7f65",
        "filename": "driver/bc12/mt6360.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 176,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003214
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-16T08:12:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nope, I2C_FLAG_PEC use crc({addr_8bit, reg, addr_8bit | 1, value}), but this use crc({addr_8bit | 1, reg, value})\n\nThere\u0027s no real reason to enable CRC afaik, but I feel it\u0027s good to enable it to detect issue early?",
      "parentUuid": "2a05622c_c8c1d355",
      "revId": "d8af83a4635035338e12a151daf8c1099bdd9764",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9836bcaa_2465667f",
        "filename": "driver/bc12/mt6360.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 176,
      "author": {
        "id": 1182824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-16T09:04:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CRC is default to on on mt6360, it\u0027s a protection for regulator on/off.",
      "parentUuid": "2a05622c_c8c1d355",
      "revId": "d8af83a4635035338e12a151daf8c1099bdd9764",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a3c23eea_0c4f299c",
        "filename": "driver/bc12/mt6360.c",
