        "id": 1141739
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-16T09:14:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack.\n\nI found a LDO I2C access CRC enable bit (reg 0x03 bit 6) in PMIC registers, it\u0027s disabled by default. do we need to enable it?",
